  "body_text": "2020.1.10\n世茂广场声音小镇店的最后一天营业日\n感谢一直以来支持我们的人们\n准备了一个结业纪念版的挂耳包\n元旦开始派送\n记得领哦\n欢迎大家到南西梅龙镇和浦东芳华路店再续\n咖啡情缘",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 0, 0);color: rgb(255, 255, 255);font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n           2020.1.10\n          </strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\">\n            世茂广场声音小镇店的最后一天营业日\n           </span>\n</strong>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 41, 65);\">\n</span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          感谢一直以来支持我们的人们\n         </span>\n</p>\n<mpvoice class=\"js_editor_audio audio_iframe res_iframe js_uneditable custom_select_card\" high_size=\"2632.25\" isaac2=\"1\" low_size=\"624.71\" name=\"感谢大家 - Luv\" play_length=\"336000\" source_size=\"624.7\" src=\"/cgi-bin/readtemplate?t=tmpl/audio_tmpl&amp;name=%E6%84%9F%E8%B0%A2%E5%A4%A7%E5%AE%B6%20-%20Luv&amp;play_length=05:36\" voice_encode_fileid=\"MzI0OTM1NDc3N18yMjQ3NDg1Mzg4\">\n</mpvoice>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          准备了一个结业纪念版的挂耳包\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          元旦开始派送\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          记得领哦\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n8LtjicTWtyL6kTG2LSQnD3zDauRGcqF4vephib3yBh8e1iaBXPDLmtH0aEvOu7WIFicJYCA3aSQXoib4Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          欢迎大家到南西梅龙镇和浦东芳华路店再续\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          咖啡情缘\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n8LtjicTWtyL6kTG2LSQnD3z1SsRVLD5luS7F224JWRCdcZh7SeWNBn43icVxK47IEoLZS1LU0axKnA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n</div>",
